<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 161,746.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 161,746.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 27 totaled 161,746 bales, down from 168,818 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 7,072 cancellations, and 18,701 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
